app/services/app_sources/play_details.py follows the Google Play request
sequence of the gpapi crate (https://github.com/EFForg/rs-google-play), and
carries its request constants (the client signature and the X-DFE-Encoded-Targets
and X-DFE-Phenotype values). gpapi is available under the MIT License and is
Copyright (c) 2021 David Weinstein. The full licence text is retained at
app/services/app_sources/GPAPI-LICENSE.txt.

