The ATLAS server image includes qmgc (https://github.com/BroBordd/qmgc), a
Qmage (.qmg) encoder, used to make Samsung boot and shutdown animations. qmgc is
Copyright (C) 2026 Bedoo and is available under the GNU General Public License,
version 3 or later. It is built from its complete source in third_party/qmgc,
with one modification described in third_party/qmgc/ATLAS.md, and runs as a
separate program; it is not part of ATLAS's Apache-2.0 licensed code. Upstream
states that its codec tables are derived from FFmpeg's LGPL-2.1-or-later
qmagedec.c/qmagedata.h.
